  "prefLabel": "Mhp 309.03 Duration of a Conditional License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mhp 309.03 Duration of a Conditional License. The conditional licensure shall be valid for a period not to exceed 2 years from the date of issuance and the conditional license holder shall be authorized to renew the conditional license one time.\n\nSource. #13903, eff 5-14-24",
